description:
T1975 Tilia x europaea;
Dense basal growth. Remove basal growth to a height of 4.0 metres. Works to be carried out in the interest of sound arboricultural practice. 
T1979 Tilia x europaea;
Low hanging branches. Basal growth. Reactive growth throughout the entire crown. Crown lift to 3.5m. Remove basal growth and crown thin by 15%. Works to be carried out in the interest of sound arboricultural practice and for health and safety to provide sufficient clearance from buildings, footpaths and drying areas. The crown thin is proposed to reduce wind resistance and weight and to allow more light through the tree. 
T1982 Fraxinus excelsior;
Low level branches. Crown lift to a height of approximately 3.0 metres. Works to be carried out for health and safety to provide sufficient clearance from buildings, footpaths and drying areas.
